{"3637210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Farm Supply Simulator 25", "steam_appid": 3637210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WELCOME TO FARM SUPPLY SIMULATOR 25!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stock your market with products, produce fertilizers and feed in your machines, and expand your farm. From animals to laboratories, from an advanced economy system to the marketplace—every detail awaits you in this realistic and comprehensive farming simulation where you can build everything from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/c77b4edef166f05495f3f61fb0498318.poster.avif?t=1770114465\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/c77b4edef166f05495f3f61fb0498318.webm?t=1770114465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/c77b4edef166f05495f3f61fb0498318.mp4?t=1770114465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>🐕 </strong></i><strong>Farm Dog – Your Loyal Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re never alone on your farm! Your loyal dog accompanies you every step of the way, bringing joy and liveliness to farm life. Interact with him by throwing a bone and spending time together, while feeling the strength of your bond at every moment. The farm dog is not just an animal—it’s a true part of your farm and your closest friend. 🐾</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/614869719c12969b39c47f208b2caae1.poster.avif?t=1770114465\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/614869719c12969b39c47f208b2caae1.webm?t=1770114465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/614869719c12969b39c47f208b2caae1.mp4?t=1770114465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛒 <strong>Manage Your Own Market!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game screen to place product orders, unpack incoming goods, and organize them in your warehouse. Stock your shelves just the way you want and get everything ready for sale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/a189ddd69d637e4908f36b942ab240fb.poster.avif?t=1770114465\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/a189ddd69d637e4908f36b942ab240fb.webm?t=1770114465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/a189ddd69d637e4908f36b942ab240fb.mp4?t=1770114465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌱 <strong>Fertilizer &amp; Feed Production – A New Path to Profit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce different types of fertilizers and feed using organic fertilizer, chemical fertilizer, and feed machines to build your own brand. Sell your products at the marketplace to increase your profits. Fertilizer and feed production is one of the most profitable ways to expand your farm and diversify your income sources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/f46e4bb8d402b195f9ec38e706f77c55.poster.avif?t=1770114465\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/f46e4bb8d402b195f9ec38e706f77c55.webm?t=1770114465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/f46e4bb8d402b195f9ec38e706f77c55.mp4?t=1770114465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WELCOME TO FARM SUPPLY SIMULATOR 25!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stock your market with products, produce fertilizers and feed in your machines, and expand your farm. From animals to laboratories, from an advanced economy system to the marketplace—every detail awaits you in this realistic and comprehensive farming simulation where you can build everything from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/c77b4edef166f05495f3f61fb0498318.poster.avif?t=1770114465\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/c77b4edef166f05495f3f61fb0498318.webm?t=1770114465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/c77b4edef166f05495f3f61fb0498318.mp4?t=1770114465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>🐕 </strong></i><strong>Farm Dog – Your Loyal Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re never alone on your farm! Your loyal dog accompanies you every step of the way, bringing joy and liveliness to farm life. Interact with him by throwing a bone and spending time together, while feeling the strength of your bond at every moment. The farm dog is not just an animal—it’s a true part of your farm and your closest friend. 🐾</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/614869719c12969b39c47f208b2caae1.poster.avif?t=1770114465\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/614869719c12969b39c47f208b2caae1.webm?t=1770114465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/614869719c12969b39c47f208b2caae1.mp4?t=1770114465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛒 <strong>Manage Your Own Market!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game screen to place product orders, unpack incoming goods, and organize them in your warehouse. Stock your shelves just the way you want and get everything ready for sale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/a189ddd69d637e4908f36b942ab240fb.poster.avif?t=1770114465\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/a189ddd69d637e4908f36b942ab240fb.webm?t=1770114465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/a189ddd69d637e4908f36b942ab240fb.mp4?t=1770114465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌱 <strong>Fertilizer &amp; Feed Production – A New Path to Profit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce different types of fertilizers and feed using organic fertilizer, chemical fertilizer, and feed machines to build your own brand. Sell your products at the marketplace to increase your profits. Fertilizer and feed production is one of the most profitable ways to expand your farm and diversify your income sources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/f46e4bb8d402b195f9ec38e706f77c55.poster.avif?t=1770114465\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/f46e4bb8d402b195f9ec38e706f77c55.webm?t=1770114465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/extras/f46e4bb8d402b195f9ec38e706f77c55.mp4?t=1770114465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Farm Supply Simulator is a realistic store and production management game where players sell farm products, produce chemical and organic fertilizers and feed, and provide farmers with soil and plant disease consulting.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Portuguese - Brazil, Arabic", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/508e12a8a7cdf9927a6da21b0086722d8b2afeff/header.jpg?t=1770114465", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/f3ee14c42e26660d6628f9fc9876ff2c96632466/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770114465", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637210/f3ee14c42e26660d6628f9fc9876ff2c96632466/capsule_184